ments with exact 74/73/72 shard custody and stages only `resolver_verified` rows\n- publishes deterministic reconstruction, state conservation, false-accept/override audit, topology validation, and a 47-artifact hash manifest without downstream writes\n\n## Terminal conservation\n\n`219 = 219 resolver_verified + 0 verified_agreement + 0 safe_rejection + 0 conflict + 0 unresolved`\n\n- verified structural staging: 219/219\n- false accepts / false overrides: 0 / 0\n- semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, or downstream writes: 0\n- Batch010 regression/reconstruction: preserved exact\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 -m scripts.vlm.issue_1682_finalize_resolution publish-final-evidence` (two byte-identical replay invocations)\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 --with pymupdf==1.27.2 --with pillow==11.3.0 --with jsonschema python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1682_final_resolution.test.py` (8 passed)\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 --with pymupdf==1.27.2 --with pillow==11.3.0 --with jsonschema python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1680_final_resolution.test.py` (9 passed)\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (healthy gates; expected dirty/upstream warnings before final commit and first push)\n\nCloses #1682\n","created_at":"2026-07-23T03:25:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T03:35:16Z","closed_at":"2026-07-23T03:35:16Z","merged_at":"2026-07-23T03:35:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"7e0b7f0f98a95aab523968e5aa873971934db0e5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1683/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1683/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1683/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.co